From: inFAMOUS FoB Recomp contributors
Subject: [PATCH 0020] video/spu: implement persistent shader cache, SPURS TLS local storage, and GCM flip pacing

- libs/video/rsx_d3d12_backend.c: Implement persistent on-disk bytecode caching (d3d12_compile_shader_cached)
  in shader_cache/ (or RSX_SHADER_CACHE_DIR), eliminating runtime D3DCompile stutters on VP/FP PSO misses.
- runtime/spu/spurs_job.c: Replace per-job 256KB calloc/free heap allocations with thread-local s_tls_ls,
  eliminating ~1,500 OS heap allocations/deallocations per second and removing Windows heap lock contention.
- libs/video/cellGcmSys.c: Unblock guest frame pacing by calling ppu_gcm_pump() inside cellGcmSetWaitFlip()
  and cellGcmGetFlipStatus(), and signal s_gcm_kick_ev on FIFO ring recycle.

